# Miqyas: one address per client company, <code>.miqyas.getmihwar.com, each
# opening the database of the same name (dbfilter ^%d$). Listed one by one:
# a wildcard certificate would need DNS-provider access Caddy does not have.
# A new client = one more name on the first line, then reload Caddy.
alamana.miqyas.getmihwar.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	@websocket path /websocket*
	reverse_proxy @websocket host.docker.internal:18072
	reverse_proxy host.docker.internal:18069
}

# The bare miqyas.getmihwar.com needs its own DNS A record ("miqyas"): the
# "*.miqyas" record makes the name exist, so the apex "*" no longer covers
# it. Add the record, then a redirect block here.
